OL,3,ACivil servant who juggled five jobs
OL,4,Afound guilty of fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA civil servant who secretly held
OL,7,Fmultiple public sector jobs on
OL,8,Ffull-time salaries has been found
OL,9,Fguilty of fraud.
OL,11,FKashim Chowdhury, from east London, had
OL,12,Ffive government jobs that overlapped in
OL,13,Fthe spring of 2023. He fraudulently
OL,14,Fearned more than #284,000 of taxpayers'
OL,15,Fmoney.
OL,17,FThe prosecution accused the 56-year-old
OL,18,Fof ''deliberate, intentional
OL,19,Fdishonesty'' and of ''exploiting the
OL,20,Fsystem''.
