OL,3,ACivil servant who juggled five jobs
OL,4,Afound guilty of fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury at Southwark Crown Court found
OL,7,Fhim guilty of nine counts of fraud,
OL,8,Fincluding making false representations
OL,9,Fand of making a dishonest gain.
